                "text": "At a time when Republicans are attacking science, slashing health care, and putting politics over patients, Democratic physicians must be organized to fight back. This week, we launched the Congressional Doctors Caucus to champion patient-centered, science-based policy. We will be vigilant, push back against dangerous misinformation, and fight for every American\u2019s right to have meaningful access to high-quality, affordable health care.",
