                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Democratic Doctors Caucus is standing together to deliver one, unified message: Hands off Medicaid. As physicians, we are not just fighting for our patients\u2014we\u2019re fighting for every American\u2019s health care. https://t.co/BRQ1Nosn4z",
