                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "More than half of Planned Parenthood\u2019s 2+ million patients nationwide rely on Medicaid for wellness checks, cancer screenings, and more.\n\nDear Speaker Johnson, Planned Parenthood is more popular than you. Hands off our health care.",
