                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Cuts to Medicaid means:\n\nFewer doctors.\nFewer hospitals.\nFewer community health clinics.\nFewer healthy people.\n\nAll for what? More tax breaks for billionaires. The cruelty is the point.",
