                "retweet_count": 16,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I heard it directly from healthcare leaders in my district: Republicans\u2019 brutal budget bill will lead to closures of hospitals and less access to life-saving care. More Oregonians will die preventable deaths if this bill passes, and I will fight like hell to keep that from happening.",
