                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As a physician who cared for patients in Oregon, I know exactly what cuts to Medicaid will mean: neighbors forced to go without care, crowded ERs, hospital closures, clinicians pushed past their limits. \n\nThe quality of health care in our state will decline for every single person.",
