                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trust doctors, not politicians for health advice! Physicians spend their entire careers reviewing the available science to make informed recommendations to patients. RFK Jr.\u2019s rhetoric about people with autism is not just unscientific\u2014it is dangerous. As the federal government is twisted into a conduit for misinformation, I encourage you to turn to your own trusted provider for what\u2019s right for you. Real healthcare is based in science, not politics.",
